<Layout title="Talk to the Team | RIPL Wealth" description="Bring your financial question to the RIPL team. Tell us the short version and we will help you find the next step.">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">TALK TO THE TEAM</div><h1>Bring the question.<br/><span class="ripl-gold">We’ll start there.</span></h1><p class="lead">You do not need a finished plan or a stack of statements. Tell us what you want your money to do, or what feels difficult to sort out.</p><a class="btn" href="#team-request">Start the Conversation →</a></div></section><section class="section questions" id="team-request"><div class="wrap team-contact-grid"><div><h2>Real people.<br/>A clear next step.</h2><p>Send the short version. Adam and Chase will receive your message, and our team will help connect you with the right person for the conversation.</p><p>Please do not include account numbers, passwords, Social Security numbers or financial documents.</p><p>Prefer to reach out directly? <a href="tel:+19704199306">(970) 419-9306</a><br/><a href="mailto:hello@riplwealth.com">hello@riplwealth.com</a></p><div class="contact-team-photo"><div class="ripl-photo-frame"><div class="photo-frame-image"><img src="/images/ripl-home-team.jpg" alt="The RIPL team in their Fort Collins office" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div></div><form class="form" action="https://formsubmit.co/adam@riplwealth.com" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_cc" value="chase@riplwealth.com"/><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="RIPL website inquiry"/><input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table"/><input type="text" name="_honey" class="honeypot" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true"/><label>Name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required/></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required/></label><label>Phone (optional)<input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"/></label><label>State<input name="state" autocomplete="address-level1" required/></label><label>What’s on your mind?<textarea name="message" required></textarea></label><p class="small">By submitting, you ask RIPL to respond to your inquiry. Delivery is processed by FormSubmit. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy details</a>.</p><button class="btn" type="submit">Send Your Question</button></form></div></section>
</Layout>
